{
  "type": "html",
  "props": {
    "content": "<style class=\"gs-plans-css\">\n/* LK round: Level Kitchen «Продолжительность» chip list (levelkitchen.com/spb —\n   .program-day__list: days, ₸/день, −% economy badge), on our own pricing.\n   Every figure is the rendered pricing matrix for the 1 200 ккал plan, re-verified\n   against the LIVE page's window.OLIVE_PRICING on 2026-08-16 (plan id 5):\n     1 день  10 000 · gift 0  · 10 000/день\n     5 дней  50 000 · gift 0  · 10 000/день\n     14 дней 140 000 · gift 14 · 5 000/день еды  (28 дней еды)\n     30 дней 300 000 · gift 30 · 5 000/день еды  (60 дней еды)\n   «−50%» is provable per-day math (5 000 vs 10 000), and holds for every plan in the\n   matrix, not a popularity claim — 5 дней is the volume leader, so 14 дней is never\n   called «популярный». Geometry deliberately mirrors the funnel's duration chips\n   (09z-configurator) so the section and the configurator read as one control.\n   data-cta plan-card-* stays distinct from the funnel's server-emitted plan-* values. */\n.gs-plans{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:30px;text-align:left}\n.gs-plan{position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;justify-content:center;\n  background:#fff;border:2px solid #E3E8DE;border-radius:18px;padding:18px 15px;\n  text-decoration:none;min-height:150px;\n  box-shadow:var(--gs-sh-card,0 14px 30px -18px rgba(32,39,26,.22));transition:border-color .15s,transform .15s}\n.gs-plan:hover,.gs-plan:focus-visible{border-color:var(--gs7-green,#3F6B39)}\n.gs-plan:active{transform:scale(.99)}\n.gs-plan--best{border-color:var(--gs7-green,#3F6B39);background:var(--gs7-spring,#DCEBC4);\n  box-shadow:var(--gs-sh-raised,0 30px 60px -30px rgba(32,39,26,.35))}\n.gs-plan__tag{position:absolute;top:-11px;left:14px;background:var(--gs7-green,#3F6B39);color:#fff;\n  font:800 11px/1.3 var(--gs-text,sans-serif);padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px;white-space:nowrap}\n.gs-plan__days{font:800 1.625rem/1 var(--gs-display,system-ui,sans-serif);\n  letter-spacing:-.04em;color:var(--gs7-ink,#20271A);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.gs-plan__per{font:800 1.0625rem/1.15 var(--gs-text,sans-serif);color:var(--gs7-green,#3F6B39);\n  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.gs-plan__per span{font-weight:700;color:var(--gs7-muted,#4E5748);font-size:.8125rem}\n.gs-plan__total{font:600 .8125rem/1.4 var(--gs-text,sans-serif);color:var(--gs7-muted,#4E5748);\n  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.gs-plan__badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:2px}\n.gs-plan__badge{background:var(--gs7-spring,#DCEBC4);color:var(--gs7-deep,#2C4E28);\n  border-radius:999px;padding:4px 10px;font:700 11px/1.3 var(--gs-text,sans-serif);white-space:nowrap}\n.gs-plan--best .gs-plan__badge{background:#fff}\n.gs-plans__note{margin:20px auto 0;max-width:52ch;font:600 .8125rem/1.5 var(--gs-text,sans-serif);\n  color:var(--gs7-muted,#4E5748);text-align:center}\n.gs-plans__foot{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-top:22px}\n@media (max-width:560px){.gs-plans__foot .gs-btn{width:100%}}\n@media (min-width:768px){.gs-plans{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.gs-plan{transition:none}.gs-plan:active{transform:none}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"gs-sec\" id=\"gsPlans\">\n  <div class=\"gs-wrap gs-center\">\n    <h2 class=\"gs-h2 gs-reveal\">Продолжительность</h2>\n    <p class=\"gs-lead gs-reveal gs-reveal--d1\">На 14 и 30 днях вы получаете столько же дней в подарок — день еды выходит вдвое дешевле.</p>\n    <div class=\"gs-plans\">\n      <a class=\"gs-plan gs-reveal\" href=\"#orderFunnel\" data-cta=\"plan-card-1\">\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__days\">1 день</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__per\">10 000 ₸ <span>/ день</span></span>\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__total\">10 000 ₸ за заказ</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"gs-plan gs-reveal gs-reveal--d1\" href=\"#orderFunnel\" data-cta=\"plan-card-5\">\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__days\">5 дней</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__per\">10 000 ₸ <span>/ день</span></span>\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__total\">50 000 ₸ за заказ</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"gs-plan gs-plan--best gs-reveal gs-reveal--d2\" href=\"#orderFunnel\" data-cta=\"plan-card-14\">\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__tag\">Выгоднее всего</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__days\">14 дней</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__per\">5 000 ₸ <span>/ день еды</span></span>\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__total\">140 000 ₸ — 28 дней еды</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__badges\"><span class=\"gs-plan__badge\">день еды −50%</span><span class=\"gs-plan__badge\">+14 дней в подарок</span></span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"gs-plan gs-reveal gs-reveal--d3\" href=\"#orderFunnel\" data-cta=\"plan-card-30\">\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__days\">30 дней</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__per\">5 000 ₸ <span>/ день еды</span></span>\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__total\">300 000 ₸ — 60 дней еды</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-plan__badges\"><span class=\"gs-plan__badge\">день еды −50%</span><span class=\"gs-plan__badge\">+30 дней в подарок</span></span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"gs-plans__note gs-reveal\">Цены — для рациона 1 200 ккал; на более калорийных рационах день дороже. Точную цену покажет форма заказа.</p>\n    <div class=\"gs-plans__foot gs-reveal gs-reveal--d1\">\n      <a class=\"gs-btn gs-btn--big\" href=\"#orderFunnel\" data-cta=\"plans-order\">Выбрать программу</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
  }
}